# 11. MetalLB Operator

Trainer demonstrated MetalLB Operator.

Purpose:

Assign external IP addresses in bare-metal Kubernetes/OpenShift clusters.

Without MetalLB:

```
LoadBalancer

↓

EXTERNAL-IP

↓

Pending
```

With MetalLB:

```
LoadBalancer

↓

External IP Assigned

↓

Application Accessible
```

