# 14. OpenShift OperatorHub

OpenShift provides **OperatorHub**.

OperatorHub allows administrators to install Operators directly from the OpenShift Web Console.

Examples:

```
OperatorHub

↓

Select Operator

↓

Install

↓

Operator Ready
```

This simplifies deployment and lifecycle management.

---

# 15. Why Enterprises Use Operators

Benefits:

- Automation
- Repeatability
- Self-healing
- Standardization
- Reduced manual intervention
- Easier upgrades

Operators capture operational best practices in software.

---

# 16. Best Practices

✔ Use Operators for complex applications.

✔ Let Operators manage lifecycle.

✔ Avoid manual cluster administration when an Operator is available.

✔ Use Custom Resources instead of modifying Operator-managed objects directly.

✔ Install trusted Operators from verified sources.

